{2}{Hello, good elf.  Might I ask who you are?}{}{5}{me 0, re 41}{27}{lf1 1}
{3}{Greetings, Ellumyn.  Might I impose on you for a moment?}{}{5}{me 1, re 41}{70}{}
{4}{Sir!  I don't believe I've ever heard such language from an elf!}{}{5}{me 0, re -40}{11}{lf1 1}
