{11}{Many are those who come to the trees of Qintarra, but none whose very presence disagrees with me so.  Away with you!}{Many are those who come to the trees of Qintarra, but none whose very presence disagrees with me so.  Away with you!}{}{}{}{}
{12}{Noble elf!  Can't we rise above these petty grievances?}{}{5}{me 0}{23}{re +10}
{13}{Please, Ellumyn.  I'd of thought we were above this sort of thing...}{}{5}{me 1}{23}{re +10}
{14}{Say that again, and you'll be thrown from these trees...}{}{5}{}{16}{re -5}
{15}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{16}{I don't believe I heard you correctly, sir.  [He looms over you, dangerously calm.]  We elves are peace-loving, but I'll not be treated disrespectfully in my own home.  Do we understand one another?}{I don't believe I heard you correctly, madam.  [He looms over you, dangerously calm.]  We elves are peace-loving, but I'll not be treated disrespectfully in my own home.  Do we understand one another?}{}{}{}{}
{17}{Clearly, sir.  I mean no offense.  My HUMBLEST apologies...}{}{5}{}{23}{re +10}
{18}{I sure hope you can fly, elf...}{}{5}{ra -3}{}{co, fl 21}
{19}{I sure hope you can fly, elven "brother"...}{}{5}{ra 3}{}{co, fl 21}
{20}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{21}{Qintarra has beauty, but also death.  Good bye, foolish one...}{Qintarra has beauty, but also death.  Good bye, foolish one...}{}{}{}{}
{23}{[The elf considers your words, then smiles.]  Yes, reason is always the better path to take.  Forgive my words, friend.  Even we elves are not without our weaker moments...}{[The elf considers your words, then smiles.]  Yes, reason is always the better path to take.  Forgive my words, friend.  Even we elves are not without our weaker moments...}{}{}{}{}
